_meanings:
A mode of interpreting a sentence. According to this mode,
 an incomplete sentence is made to yield complete sense by supplying some
 extra word or words therein. {#aDyAhAra#} should be clearly distinguished
 from {#anuzaNga#} which also is a mode of interpreting an incomplete sentence;
 {#paripUrRamevedaM vAkyaM nADyAhAramarhati vipralamBakartfkam#} <ls>ŚB. on MS. 4. 3. 10</ls>
 (see {#anuzaNga#}). <ab>cf.</ab> also {#aparipUrRaM yad vAkyaM#}
 {#tadaDyAhAreRa vA pUryeta vyavahitakalpanayA vA . tatrADyAhArAd vyavahitakalpanA#}
 {#jyAyasI . aDyAhAre hi aSrutaH kalpyeta . itaratra Srutena sambanDaH .#}
 <ls>ŚB. on MS. 7. 4. 10</ls>.
